{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flick your striker to pocket coins &amp; earn Bucks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109010/extras/7dee2a138205baeba27d50af80453b50.poster.avif?t=1760762696\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109010/extras/7dee2a138205baeba27d50af80453b50.webm?t=1760762696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109010/extras/7dee2a138205baeba27d50af80453b50.mp4?t=1760762696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your Striker's Flick to push coins towards Pockets, basic mechanism of carrom board game .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Earn Bucks when each coin hits Pocket.\u00a0<i><strong>Arcade certified satisfaction!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spend Bucks to Unlock Items &amp; Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109010/extras/67d243f63a4d258dbbc4cfa5f84557a7.poster.avif?t=1760762696\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109010/extras/67d243f63a4d258dbbc4cfa5f84557a7.webm?t=1760762696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109010/extras/67d243f63a4d258dbbc4cfa5f84557a7.mp4?t=1760762696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard earned bucks on Items &amp; Upgrades. Purchase items which helps you pocket more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >coins. The more coins you pocket, the richer you get. Unlock Upgrades to increase the value of your coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The rich gets richer!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assistance at your Service!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109010/extras/678a4ba07777715c7a4c211406e7c469.poster.avif?t=1760762696\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109010/extras/678a4ba07777715c7a4c211406e7c469.webm?t=1760762696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109010/extras/678a4ba07777715c7a4c211406e7c469.mp4?t=1760762696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take assistance of some explosives to automate your work and help you earn more in shorter time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still your\u00a0Precised flick will always stand its value at work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer each Board!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109010/extras/2518863a103359dd4fb09f730167d7da.avif?t=1760762696\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get Richest, unlock all upgrades &amp; move to next board. Use your skills in varied boards to conquer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109010?t=1760762696","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109010/f4eb61e3c41ed8f45913139431091714eb480563/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760762696","